  "Venue data": "The circuit was traced from the official 2025 Singapore Grand Prix map onto OpenStreetMap roads (lap 4.94 km vs 4.940 official); the stretch beside the Singapore Flyer is not in OpenStreetMap, so it follows the map. Gates 1 to 8, named grandstands, MRT stations, first aid, restrooms and information points come from that map; positions are approximate. Hospitality lounges, food stands and merchandise are not placed. Layouts change each year: check the current map."
